<% content_for :grid_word do %>INSPIRING<% end %>

<!-- Featured Story: Walenweeshuis -->
<section class="py-12">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
    <p class="section-label mb-4">Featured Story</p>
    <h1>Three Years in the Walenweeshuis</h1>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-muted">
      From May 2022 to August 2025, the NFT Playground called the Walenweeshuis home — a 17th-century orphanage in the heart of Amsterdam, turned into a living lab for digital art, blockchain culture, and community.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="pb-12">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
    <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-subtle" style="padding-top:56.25%;">
      <iframe
        src="https://iframe.mediadelivery.net/embed/460478/8a50afbd-7e31-4d00-8f37-cb5c79a5d54d?autoplay=false&preload=true"
        loading="lazy"
        style="border:none;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;"
        allow="accelerometer;gyroscope;autoplay;encrypted-media;picture-in-picture"
        allowfullscreen>
      </iframe>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-8">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl">
    <p>What started as an experiment became a movement. For over three years, the Walenweeshuis was the place where artists, builders, and curious minds came together to explore the intersection of art, technology, and community.</p>

    <p>NFT exhibitions lined the walls of a building that once sheltered children — now sheltering ideas. Crypto drinks on Tuesday nights. Workshops on Wednesday afternoons. Pop-up events that spilled into the courtyard. A space where you could walk in with nothing and walk out with a project, a collaborator, or a completely new perspective.</p>

    <p>The chapter at the Walenweeshuis has closed, but what was built there lives on — in the people who connected, the projects that launched, and the culture that grew from within those walls.</p>

    <div class="my-10 flex items-center gap-4" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="h-px flex-1 bg-subtle"></span>
      <span class="hand text-lg">✳</span>
      <span class="h-px flex-1 bg-subtle"></span>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center">
      <p class="hand text-2xl">"We didn't just exhibit art — we lived it."</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">— The Playground community</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Timeline -->
<section class="py-12">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl">
    <h2 class="hand text-center">The Timeline</h2>
    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6">
      <div class="intent-card">
        <span class="section-label text-muted">May 2022</span>
        <h3 class="mt-1 text-lg font-bold">Doors Open</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">The NFT Playground moves into the Walenweeshuis. First exhibitions go up. The space comes alive.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="intent-card">
        <span class="section-label text-muted">2022 — 2023</span>
        <h3 class="mt-1 text-lg font-bold">Community Takes Root</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">Weekly crypto drinks, artist residencies, DAO experiments. A network of creators forms around the space.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="intent-card">
        <span class="section-label text-muted">2023 — 2024</span>
        <h3 class="mt-1 text-lg font-bold">Expanding Horizons</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">Cosmolocal launches. Local entrepreneurs discover Web3. The Playground becomes a bridge between worlds.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="intent-card">
        <span class="section-label text-muted">2024 — 2025</span>
        <h3 class="mt-1 text-lg font-bold">Legacy in Motion</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">The KeyPass community solidifies. Governance takes shape. The seeds planted at the Walenweeshuis scatter across Amsterdam.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="intent-card">
        <span class="section-label text-muted">August 2025</span>
        <h3 class="mt-1 text-lg font-bold">A Chapter Closes</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">The Walenweeshuis era ends. The community carries forward — the Playground is not a building, it's a movement.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="py-12 text-center">
  <h2 class="hand">The story continues.</h2>
  <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-lg text-muted">The Playground is looking for its next home. The community is still here — still creating, still connecting, still playing the future.</p>
  <div class="mt-8">
    <%= render 'layouts/button', text: "Get Involved", href: get_involved_path %>
  </div>
</section>
